      'Testing Procedure — Perform the following tests only with accounts and files you control in an authorized test environment: Identify a workflow that uploads a file to temporary storage and later submits a file identifier, basename, or token to associate it with a record. Record the temporary reference and the field’s accepted types. Upload a harmless file allowed by a general file upload field. Observe the file’s li…',
